<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes all four credit auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes all four credit auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico completed all four credit auctions to inject 5.903 billion pesos in the secondary market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	MAXIMUM    MINUMUM    AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.634 bln  14 days   25.25	25.11	25.16</p>
<p>    1.635 bln  13 days   25.18	25.08	25.11</p>
<p>    1.634 bln   8 days   25.02	24.78	24.85</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day    24.63	24.63	24.63</p>
<p>Maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Patricia Lezama, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
